<title>JAPAN: Sotetsu Rosen -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sotetsu Rosen -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 60.91		vs	   60.47</p>
<p> Operating	    1.12		vs	  921    million</p>
<p> Current	    850    million    vs	  701    million</p>
<p> Net		  439    million    vs	  403    million</p>
<p> EPS		   15.66 yen	  vs	   14.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sotetsu Rosen Co Ltd is a regional supermarket operator affiliated with Sagami Railway Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
